Circular wavy progress geometry
Copyright 2022-2025 The Android Open Source Project

The Rust files in shapes.rs and shapes/ adapt the rounded polygon, cubic,
length measurement, feature mapping, and morph algorithms from AndroidX
Graphics Shapes 1.1.0. Tessera restricts the private shape constructors to the
circle and rounded star used by circular progress indicators.

https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+/androidx-main/graphics/graphics-shapes/

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
See ../../assets/material_loading_shapes.LICENSE for the complete license.

The independent test fixture in assets/circular_wave_reference.bin is generated
by tools/material-shapes/GenerateCircularWaveReference.java using the official
Graphics Shapes 1.1.0 library. It is only included in test builds.
